@using Microsoft.Extensions.Options
@model LinkedIn.MVC.Models.ViewModels.CompanyFormViewModel
@inject IOptions<LinkedIn.MVC.Services.JobiApiOptions> ApiOptions
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = Model.IsEdit ? "Edit Company" : "Create Company";
    var apiBaseUrl = ApiOptions.Value.BaseUrl.TrimEnd('/');
}

<div class="inner-banner-one position-relative">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xl-6 m-auto text-center">
                <div class="title-two"><h2 class="text-white">@(Model.IsEdit ? "Edit Company" : "Create Your Company")</h2></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="pt-100 lg-pt-80 pb-150 lg-pb-80">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-7 m-auto">
                <div asp-validation-summary="All" class="alert alert-danger"></div>

                <form asp-action="CompanyProfile" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                    <input type="hidden" asp-for="IsEdit" />

                    <div class="row align-items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="col-auto">
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.CurrentLogoUrl))
                            {
                                <img src="@(apiBaseUrl + Model.CurrentLogoUrl)" alt="Company logo" class="rounded-circle" style="width:80px; height:80px; object-fit:cover;" />
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <div class="rounded-circle bg-light d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width:80px; height:80px;">
                                    <i class="bi bi-building fs-2"></i>
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <label asp-for="Logo" class="form-label fw-500">Company logo</label>
                            <input asp-for="Logo" type="file" class="form-control" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp" />
                            <small class="text-muted">JPG, PNG, or WEBP. Maximum 2 MB.</small>
                            <span asp-validation-for="Logo" class="text-danger"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label asp-for="Name" class="form-label fw-500">Company name*</label>
                        <input asp-for="Name" class="form-control" placeholder="Acme Inc." />
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label asp-for="WebsiteUrl" class="form-label fw-500">Website</label>
                        <input asp-for="WebsiteUrl" type="url" class="form-control" placeholder="https://example.com" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label asp-for="Description" class="form-label fw-500">About the company</label>
                        <textarea asp-for="Description" class="form-control" rows="6" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn-one">@(Model.IsEdit ? "Save changes" : "Create company")</button>
                    @if (Model.IsEdit)
                    {
                        <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary ms-2">Cancel</a>
                    }
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>